Scope and third-party material
--------------------------------

1. DetectiumFire images are not included in this repository and are not
   relicensed by this notice. Users must obtain them separately.
2. DetectiumFire combines material from multiple sources. Those source assets
   remain governed by their original licenses and terms. Its paper lists
   CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for web-search and IoT material, CC0 for FIRE Dataset
   material, CC BY 4.0 for Forest Fire material, and MIT for FireNET material,
   and recommends restricting the web-collected data to academic use.
3. This license does not grant trademark, privacy, publicity, or other rights
   that the repository author does not control.
4. Teacher responses are AI-generated content produced through an Alibaba
   Cloud Model Studio inference API. This notice applies only when the service
   terms governing the account and mode used for generation allow publication
   and redistribution. In particular, Model Studio trial-service outputs may
   carry stricter restrictions and must not be treated as covered merely by
   this repository license.
5. Construction and distillation source code is not distributed in this
   repository and is outside the scope of this license.

No warranty
-----------

To the extent permitted by law, the material is provided as-is, without
warranties or conditions of any kind. It is research data and must not be used
as a substitute for professional fire-safety assessment.
